# Environment Variables

## Frontend (Vite)

Create a `.env` file in the root directory:

```env
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
VITE_R2_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-test-token
VITE_USE_R2=false
```

### Storage Mode Configuration

- `VITE_USE_R2=true` - Use Cloudflare R2 storage (云端存储)
- `VITE_USE_R2=false` - Use localStorage (本地存储)
- If not set, defaults to:
  - Development: localStorage
  - Production: R2

Note: You can also switch storage mode directly from the UI using the storage mode selector in the header.

## Production

```env
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-worker.your-subdomain.workers.dev
VITE_R2_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-production-token
VITE_USE_R2=true
```

## Cloudflare Workers

Create a `.dev.vars` file in the workers/r2-proxy directory:

```env
API_TOKEN=your-secure-api-token
```
